        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "손끝을 점멸시켜서\n대화하는 듯하나 그 패턴은\n아직 해독하지 못했다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il fait clignoter ses doigts tricolores pour communiquer\navec ses semblables. Son langage reste un mystère.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es spricht, indem es seine Fingerspitzen leuchten\nlässt, doch noch konnte der Code dahinter nicht\nentziffert werden.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Parece que se comunica haciendo brillar sus dedos\ntricolores, pero nadie ha conseguido descifrar aún su\npatrón.",
